description:
Design a 9-bit wide signed adder that produces a 10-bit output. The module takes two 9-bit inputs, A and B, and performs addition while considering the carry from the most significant bit. The output, O, consists of a 1-bit carry out as the most significant bit (O[9]), followed by the sum of A and B. The adder's design incorporates logic gates to handle the necessary carry and sum calculations, ensuring that it accurately represents the result of adding two signed numbers.
module top_module(
    A,
    B,
    O
);

